# Super Review ({PROJECT_NAME})

**ROLE:** Self-contained deep-review coordinator + final validator.
**OUTPUT:** ONE merged, de-duplicated, severity-prioritized, validated report.

Main-session coordination only. Invoked inside a subagent whose `tools:` does not grant `Agent`,
return the review request to the main orchestrator instead. Review workers never re-delegate or edit
files; coordinator report writing and the explicitly scoped self-sync remain allowed.

